  "reflectionText": "Jacob was left alone and wrestled with a man until daybreak. The man touched his thigh, and Jacob limped. Jacob said: I will not let you go unless you bless me. He was given a new name: Israel. What is it to be given a blessing you wrestled for all night, and to walk away from it with a limp you will carry the rest of your days?"
}
